                  "oneOfCase": "RRT_V2_BLOCK_ELEMENTS_JSON",
                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Westbury Communications, how may I help you?\\nB: Hi, my name is Brandy Doyle, and I live at 548 Colburn Road. My Internet connection has been really bad since last night. I tried calling your 24-hour hotline, but there was no answer.\\nA: I’m very sorry about that, ma’am. Could you describe the problem?\\nB: The connection is very slow, and sometimes it cuts out entirely. I have a video conference scheduled for this evening, so I need this issue resolved quickly.\\nA: All right. I’ll have one of our repair technicians visit your home right away.\"}]]}]]}"
                }
              }
